context:
DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}
Deletes an existing zone.
Required: zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}
Retrieves detailed information about a specific zone identified by its zone ID. Returns zone configuration, status, nameservers, and associated metadata.
Required: zone_id (path)

PATCH /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}
Edits a zone. Only one zone property can be changed at a time.
Required: zone_id (path); body (body)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/available_plans/{plan_identifier}
Details of the available plan that the zone can subscribe to.
Required: plan_identifier (path); zone_id (path)
